{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01D6rzfvZCSv9Mqg81vUAHsf", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lo-fi_music\"}, {\"url\": \"https://steemit.steemapps.com/music/@mabh/lo-fi-music\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wikipedia2007.classicistranieri.com/l/o/-/Lo-fi_music.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://escholarship.org/content/qt3wd7882q/qt3wd7882q.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wiki.onul.works/w/Lo-Fi\"}, {\"url\": \"https://tmbw.net/wiki/Shows/1987-03-04\"}, {\"url\": \"https://whakoom.com/ediciones/510911/the_best_of_lcd_the_art_and_writing_of_wfmu-softcover_238_pp\"}, {\"url\": \"https://search.worldcat.org/oclc/86037987\"}, {\"url\": \"https://monoskop.org/log/?p=3626\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.radioworld.com/?p=79690\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:04:27.908Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "WFMU 1986 \"Low-Fi\" segment DJ home tapes listeners", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01PRwi2JkedPcJ89rpt5wqD6", "content": [{"title": "Lo-fi music", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lo-fi_music"}, {"title": "LO-FI music", "url": "https://steemit.steemapps.com/music/@mabh/lo-fi-music"}, {"title": "New Immissions/Updates:", "url": "https://wikipedia2007.classicistranieri.com/l/o/-/Lo-fi_music.html"}, {"title": "escholarship.org", "url": "https://escholarship.org/content/qt3wd7882q/qt3wd7882q.pdf"}, {"title": "Lo Fi", "url": "https://wiki.onul.works/w/Lo-Fi"}, {"title": "tmbw.net", "url": "https://tmbw.net/wiki/Shows/1987-03-04"}, {"title": "the best of lcd the art and writing of wfmu softcover 238 pp", "url": "https://whakoom.com/ediciones/510911/the_best_of_lcd_the_art_and_writing_of_wfmu-softcover_238_pp"}, {"title": "Front cover image for The best of LCD : the art and writing of WFMU", "url": "https://search.worldcat.org/oclc/86037987"}, {"title": "LCD (Lowest Common Denominator), 18-27 (1997-2001)", "url": "https://monoskop.org/log/?p=3626"}, {"title": "www.radioworld.com", "url": "https://www.radioworld.com/?p=79690"}]}, "The search turned up several sources on William Berger's WFMU segment, though they conflict on dates and detail.\n\n- **Origin and dates:** Wikipedia says the term is generally tied to William Berger's half-hour WFMU show *Low-Fi*, which ran from 1986 to 1987 (Wikipedia's lo-fi article is the source here). Other pages describe the segment as running \"late 1986\" or \"through out the late 80's,\" so the exact span is unsettled.\n- **Format:** Per Wikipedia, the program had no host-produced material. Its entire contents came from mailed-in submissions, and it aired in a 30-minute prime-time evening slot every Friday (1-4).\n- **Contemporary description:** The fall 1986 issue of WFMU's guide LCD characterized the show as home recordings made on cheap equipment, pairing technical primitivism with brilliance (1-5,1-6).\n- **Naming:** Berger is usually credited with popularizing the term \"lo-fi\" through this segment (1-1). Some sources are fan or user-generated sites, so treat their claims with caution."], "durationSeconds": 5.6148324999999994, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01D6rzfvZCSv9Mqg81vUAHsf", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDY586WBQnTJYLaU3KGd", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：William Berger（威廉·伯杰）。** 1986 年，他在 WFMU 开了一个每周半小时的节目环节 “Low-Fi”，专门播听众寄来的家庭录音带。一般认为 “lo-fi” 这个说法就是从这档节目流行起来的。\n\n搜了 1 次。各来源对节目播了多久说法不一：维基百科写的是 1986–1987 年，有的网页写“整个 80 年代后期”。但是不是 Berger 开的这个环节，各来源说法一致。\n\n依据：\n- [Lo-fi music – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lo-fi_music)\n- [Lo-fi music（维基百科 2007 年存档）](https://wikipedia2007.classicistranieri.com/l/o/-/Lo-fi_music.html)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1182, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4310, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1182}, "output_tokens": 294, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:04:32.429Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDY57q8YEWhPZ9t6afWo"}
